            "created_at": "2025-08-05T19:10:17.636381+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 3 power pick up is dependant on what kind of composition is the enemy running if they are running bunch of dive heroes like [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6)  [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457)  [Lucio](hero_b38c5d54-a585-4545-b0b8-4d4b205b3768)  [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) etc. You need to get  [Double Barrelled](item_962b847f-140d-41a4-9bac-ddcdb088951e) if not you can get [Calamity](item_d6cdfbfe-61f4-4aa2-979f-f7793000b15c)  for extra damage.\n\nFor items If you are doing good and generating a lot of cash  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce)  will be the main choice here. If you don't have lots of cash  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) is also good. If you have over 10k  [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) is good against  [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85)  [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6)  [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) if they have lots of fliers like  [Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18)  [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da)  [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424)   [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204)  is also a decent pick up. However i would suggest to pick  [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204)  if they at least have 2 fliers.",
