            "notes": "On round 4 we are definitely aiming for more raw damage therefore we are gonna try to go for  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) but if you don't have a lot of money for that same as last round  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a)  [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27)   [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) are very good options.\n\nUpdate: If you haven't gotten  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) Previous round sell everything apart from  [Ironsights](item_a6238751-a22b-41d1-b197-38b895df1e62) to get it this round\n\nImportant note:\nIf you picked  [Calamity](item_d6cdfbfe-61f4-4aa2-979f-f7793000b15c)  second round you can opt for  [Infrared Lenses](item_f19df350-745e-4e97-a495-8036b0be1262)  this round. Not only this is a cheap item but also it is gonna provide us flat 20% damage boost against burning targets. Which we will achieve through  [Calamity](item_d6cdfbfe-61f4-4aa2-979f-f7793000b15c)  and Dynamite.",
